{"version":1,"content":"<p>蔡卓妍（阿Sa）今天（13日）出席時裝品牌活動，同場還有林峯、泰國女星Kimberley Anne Woltemas及馬天佑。</p><p>阿Sa表示與鍾欣潼（阿嬌）要放聖誕假，因此12月的《TWINS SIDE BY SIDE CONCERT》絕不加場。</p><p>她透露已擬定好一份「無懈可擊」的歌單，惟曲目足以演出3天，因此正着手刪減，亦考慮加入少量舞蹈，但不會表演側手翻。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:07.145633+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T11:22:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723830+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723830+00:00","content_hash":"6ff2b0684b3cf8d10aa00b79fac30bed5c959b0e62418964116e2e60b7994630","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}